# Experiments

Research-experiment memory for <PROJECT NAME>. Four surfaces:

- [`LEDGER.md`](LEDGER.md) — numbered findings: what we currently believe,
  with evidence links. Grep it before designing anything new.
- [`ROADMAP.md`](ROADMAP.md) — the experiment queue, ranked by
  payoff × cost, with assumption dependencies.
- [`INBOX.md`](INBOX.md) — human scratchpad for raw ideas; ask an agent to
  "sweep the experiments inbox" to formalize them into the ROADMAP.
- `<NNN>-<slug>/REPORT.md` — one report per experiment: pre-registration,
  results tables, conclusion, provenance.

Scaffold a new experiment with the skill's `scripts/new-experiment.py`;
refresh the map + index below with `scripts/render-index.py`.

